                instead, paste it below.
              </p>
              <div className="mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
                <code className="flex-1 truncate rounded bg-[var(--tint-subtle)] px-2 py-1 text-xs">{fnbRedirectUri(connecting)}</code>
